<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-GERMAN CUP QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GERMAN CUP QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of German Cup quarter-final</p>
<p>matches on Wednesday:</p>
<p> Hamburg	   2     Bochum		 1</p>
<p> Freiburg	  1     VfB Stuttgart	1 after extra time</p>
<p>(90 minutes 1-1. Stuttgart won 4-2 on penalties)</p>
</text>
